Package: GEMcluster
Type: Package
Title: Semiparametric Elliptical Mixture Clustering
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Dan", "Zhuang", role = "aut"),
    person("Long", "Feng", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "flnankai@gmail.com")
  )
Description: Implements generalized expectation-maximization clustering for
    high-dimensional semiparametric elliptical mixtures with cluster-specific
    centers, an unknown common radial generator, and a common sparse
    precision-shape matrix. The algorithm combines robust sparse K-median
    initialization, nonparametric radial-generator estimation,
    Tyler-type shape estimation, POET regularization, graphical lasso, and a
    GAP-statistic selector for the number of clusters. The methodology is
    described in Feng and Zhuang (2026) <doi:10.48550/arXiv.2605.08995>.
